    "number": 21,
    "title": "Geometric Intelligence \u2014 route-native local engine",
    "description": "Build a route-native local geometric engine with demonstrated language binding and coherent behavior. Latest #1079/#1080: LANGUAGE_R4_PRESERVED_CONTROL_WEAK. Both soft mixtures preserve all 25,600 answers and 358,400 supervised roles; 156 criteria pass. Fact control strong in 6/6 views; token control in 3/6; all controls valid. Exact replay, 57.0422 s, 2.217148 GiB. Next: separately freeze a construction-only, attention-weighted token-frame exposure diagnostic with the reader/core/data/control fixed. Retain primary preservation and strong fact sensitivity; the weaker token-control cause is unmeasured. Given clauses, known vocabulary and observed worlds limit the claim. No retraining, generation or geometry expansion. #973 open; #954 blocked; broad QA dormant.",
